requirements 在庫 v1
description "dandori の例 fulfillment の倉庫と出荷のサービスの約束を、.proto の要素で名指したテストの材料。出典は約束の文書を保存して固定する"

role 倉庫 "在庫のサービスの約束を決める"
role 開発 ".proto を書いて直す"

source 約束 = file "約束.md" sha256:6876e197cbb677f0

scope proto "warehouse.proto" service StockService method

requirement 在庫を押さえる(reserve)
  text "倉庫は、注文の一行ごとに在庫を押さえる。足りなければ、押さえずに足りないと答える"
  owner 倉庫
  from @約束
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 倉庫 sha256:6876e197cbb677f0 -> sha256:e10350fc1754b540
  satisfied by proto "warehouse.proto" service StockService method Reserve
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 開発 sha256:e10350fc1754b540 -> sha256:cadb2fc727e9af81
  satisfied by proto "warehouse.proto" enum Stock
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 開発 sha256:e10350fc1754b540 -> sha256:d7450e7503c905f7
  not verified "この材料は、サービスを走らせる主張を持たない"
    approved 2026-10-04 by 倉庫 sha256:e10350fc1754b540

requirement 押さえを放す(release)
  text "押さえた在庫は、押さえたときの番号で放せる"
  owner 倉庫
  from @約束
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 倉庫 sha256:6876e197cbb677f0 -> sha256:e4cf3d1ba8da98bf
  satisfied by proto "warehouse.proto" service StockService method Release
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 開発 sha256:e4cf3d1ba8da98bf -> sha256:2a0912a66889e515
  not verified "この材料は、サービスを走らせる主張を持たない"
    approved 2026-10-04 by 倉庫 sha256:e4cf3d1ba8da98bf

requirement 出荷(fulfill)
  text "出荷は、注文を受けて始まり、押さえた在庫と追跡番号を答える"
  owner 倉庫
  from @約束
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 倉庫 sha256:6876e197cbb677f0 -> sha256:a56299dbcadd3c9f
  satisfied by proto "fulfillment.proto" service FulfillmentService method Fulfill
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 開発 sha256:a56299dbcadd3c9f -> sha256:6c73e17bf5bedba7
  satisfied by proto "fulfillment.proto" message FulfillResponse field tracking_number
    reviewed 2026-10-04 by 開発 sha256:a56299dbcadd3c9f -> sha256:fb7f7e2617539e54
  not verified "この材料は、サービスを走らせる主張を持たない"
    approved 2026-10-04 by 倉庫 sha256:a56299dbcadd3c9f
